# __NAME__

Built with [Winged-Python](https://github.com/micheltlutz/Winged-Python).

```bash
winged build           # write dist/
winged serve --watch   # preview at http://127.0.0.1:8000, rebuilding on change
```

`site.py` generates the pages, `layout.py` holds the shared shell, `assets/` is copied
verbatim. `dist/` is generated output — do not edit or commit it.
